            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_color": "",
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_zRpgCq": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I choose the right size for my pet?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_bYYfLh": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Check the measurements and size guide on the product page before choosing a size. Measure your pet rather than relying on their breed or usual size, as sizing can vary between products. If you are unsure, <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> with the product name and your pet’s measurements before ordering.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "font_size_mobile": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_bYYfLh"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_tmCqJP": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How should I care for my pet’s new gear?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_xVJGDr": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Follow the care instructions provided on the product page or product label. Check items regularly for wear, loose parts, or damage, and replace them when needed. Let cleaned items dry fully before your pet uses them again.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "font_size_mobile": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_xVJGDr"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_6hMjXY": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is this product suitable for my pet?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_8Mmw9i": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Review the product description for its intended use, sizing, materials, and any age or weight guidance. Choose items that suit your pet’s size and habits, introduce new gear gradually, and supervise use. Need help with a specific product? <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Ask us before ordering.</a></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "font_size_mobile": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_8Mmw9i"
              ]
            },
            "faq_pet_4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "When will my order arrive?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "answer": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Delivery timing depends on the item and destination. Review the shipping information shown at checkout and in your order confirmation. If you have a question about an existing order, <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> with your order number so we can help.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "font_size_mobile": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "answer"
              ]
            },
            "faq_pet_5": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What if an item does not fit or arrives damaged?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "answer": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Please review the store’s return policy for eligibility and conditions, then <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> with your order number and a description of the issue. For a damaged or incorrect item, include clear photos of the item and packaging so we can review what happened.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "font_size_mobile": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
